#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Serve the current project's Accord records as a local live web view.

Usage: tools/serve [--task TASK] [--port PORT] [--no-open]

The server binds to localhost, reads records without changing them, and exits
when the terminal process is interrupted.
"""

